'',f"All **19 root MP4s** were inventoried, hashed and decoded into **4,559 native 1920×1080 JPEGs**. No exact duplicate MP4 checksums were found. Every frame has measured provenance, pose/eye/expression/photographic proxies, and exclusion reasons. All 114 chronological contact sheets were reviewed. The new clips add endpoint variety but do not establish a coherent photographic two-dimensional surface. The best early V15 horizontal sequence remains useful; short vertical and diagonal fragments also exist. These one-dimensional fragments do not justify a partial 2D renderer.",
'',f"At the moderate automatic screen, **{summary['screening_valid']:,} frames** survive, but **29.9%** of the tested interior rectangle lies more than two approximate model degrees from a surviving photograph. Small-circle nearest selection changes source **27 times**, with a **3.40°** maximum estimated pose step; the 75%-radius circle reaches **11.40°** steps. These are offline diagnostics, not measured browser tracking performance. Relaxing all quality exclusions still leaves geometric gaps. Numerical density and matching endpoints therefore cannot earn GO.",
'','The requested source gate was applied before implementation. No V18 cursor controller, facial blending, morphing, optical-flow synthesis, generated footage, promotion, or merge was created. A separate audit viewer plays the unchanged original MP4s. Existing V14, V15, frozen prototypes, original portfolio, rollback files and source videos are preserved.',
'','## Evidence scope and uncertainty','',
